{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07225ad88f4c07c032a3abd87d2d482e8777364e13669c2d1965fe5bc6c42e08", "ja": "（今日は、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n響がカフェで働く様子を撮影している……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的日子。\n正在拍摄响在咖啡店工作的样子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "49a4d215cfa02f101c69aef089a8429461aa15da178bbef117025fd294475f1e", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！　\n自分のウェイトレス姿、どうだった？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n我穿女服务员制服的样子，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ce3c168a52b863308d1a1999eccc4d82e8df57b624839c8f3b1a0cf58ebd1c72", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってたぞ。\nホールで働く姿も、生き生きしてたな！", "zh": "啊，很适合你。\n你在大厅里工作的样子也很有活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "f0f6502f6d039ed83a9fff4d469d60d3809826996aee8495d9bb628f60211f9c", "ja": "でしょでしょ！　このカフェすっごくオシャレだし、\nお客さんたちもみんな優しいから、楽しいんだ♪", "zh": "对吧对吧！这家咖啡馆特别时髦，客人们也都很温柔，所以很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e31de60dec14b266347632e67f64261985ad8bbafba8feed507d1191bc77e6d6", "ja": "それなら良かった。動物も一緒に飲食できる店だから\n響にピッタリだと思ってね。", "zh": "那就好。因为这家店可以让动物一起用餐，我觉得很适合响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "9de843f86a312316d4c4585546a4227312f03376df376f6723b173828425968d", "ja": "ありがとね、{$P$}。\n今日はいろんな動物に出会えて、すっごくうれしいぞ！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n今天能遇到各种各样的动物，我特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "96dc5537fde195627d2d1cf0e058b16461b11b0e108ce27efb82ec301554e2e7", "ja": "でも……実はちょっと気になってることがあるんだ。", "zh": "不过……其实有件事让我有点在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6ff771b420ed47c728bdce70d56226fe129dfd10ed5994af2fd80b583729d6f5", "ja": "気になってること？", "zh": "有件事很在意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "7b30c7095649514d7b8e4df48e996fe1bf7e4cbf27387a98d884b8382ee4ebbf", "ja": "うん。動物たちの様子を見てたんだけど、うれしそうに\nしてる子もいれば、そうじゃない子もいるみたい……。", "zh": "嗯。我观察了一下动物们的情况，\n发现有的看起来很高兴，有的却好像不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "6d344d83e4c99911c71f5f9ff79eb3627b20caeb15b0bdabdfc413b73f342ee3", "ja": "うーん……お店の雰囲気を気にしてるわけじゃないし、\n店員さんを警戒してる感じもしないし……。", "zh": "嗯……倒不是在意店里的氛围，也不像是在提防店员……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1010_p", "source_sha256": "754f77e2c6d1e09732a841130166fd571011855255d2bfb6855abb5647281e64", "ja": "なるほど……。\n楽しい気持ちになりにくい何かがあるってことか……。", "zh": "原来如此……\n也就是说，有什么原因让人很难感到开心吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "81f38731427a022955193ae38ad7127e16ea10373e1f96e7e1227cd3b1396460", "ja": "楽しくなれない……あっ！\nもしかしたら、好きな食べ物がないのかも！？", "zh": "没法开心起来……啊！\n说不定是因为没有喜欢吃的东西！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8946012766171bff263b4fddac9b2a10b8a2289fd39e190527fb6065354e5313", "ja": "食べ物か……。\n確かに、動物たちにも好き嫌いはあるよな。", "zh": "食物啊……确实，动物们也有自己喜欢和不喜欢的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "ca81786eecb02e46a94496f934b56564523e5a739b94574f0de70f7313bd3ba8", "ja": "うん！　同じ動物でも、それぞれ好みは違うからね。\nもっと動物のメニューを増やしたらいいかも！", "zh": "嗯！就算是同一种动物，喜好也各不相同嘛。\n要是能多增加一些动物的菜单，或许会更好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dae9284f4294818005d3f2c568cd29bc80bec09735e1f02b3b461c2db2557c63", "ja": "おお、いい案だな！\n響だからこそ気づけるナイスアイディアだ！", "zh": "哦，不错的主意！\n果然只有响才能注意到这么棒的点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "f84ff4715cb0ac39c0adf2bab45619667ebef0179879aaef6a42ecdf50ec415a", "ja": "ふふん♪　動物たちのことなら任せてよ！　すっごく\nいいお店だから、気持ちよく過ごしてもらいたいし。", "zh": "哼哼♪　要说动物们的事就交给我吧！因为是家特别棒的店，所以我也希望它们能舒舒服服地待着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "9292b4e3f9a26f2529c79af5c880a0dd7a2ba36c046c450662980af507459276", "ja": "それじゃ、お店の人に伝えて……あっ。\n撮影とは関係ないし、迷惑になるかな……？", "zh": "那就去跟店里的人说……啊。  \n这和拍摄没关系，会不会给人添麻烦啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1017_p", "source_sha256": "94659bd2cabbe38f6ed80e6647f675566849975a44958e7dbc65063c3af4da0b", "ja": "大丈夫。響がお客さんのためを思って考えたことだ。\n堂々と提案していいと思うぞ！", "zh": "没事的。这是响为客人们着想才想出来的办法。\n我觉得堂堂正正去提建议就行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "5f0e229065ee84f0ef06c459fdc98cc4556c5e0c78e7fb78bd7a024e15842459", "ja": "そっか、そうだよね！\nじゃあ、さっそくお店の人に相談してくる！", "zh": "这样啊，确实是呢！\n那我这就去和店里的人商量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0293_1019_p", "source_sha256": "be0fdf99e493a9e3ec5862c0c5d6c40e4a72ccf10a9db5681af72a35795f45bc", "ja": "（響の提案は、お店の人にとても喜ばれた。\n響のモチベーションも上がり、いい撮影になったな！）", "zh": "（响的提议让店里的人非常高兴。\n响的干劲也提高了，拍摄进行得很顺利！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
